## Improvements Based on Feedback
- **Merged Icon**: The microchip and infinity symbols are now a single cohesive unit.
- **Vine Style**: Reduced branching in favor of sleek, flowing sarmaşık-style transitions.
- **Professional Focus**: Symbol-only designs following "Pro" model aesthetics.
- **IC Schematics**: Integrated circuit patterns woven directly into the loops.

